      "actor": "ai:dm",
      "type": "journal.entry.added",
      "payload": {
        "body": "Wenna Marsh, the ferry keeper, recounts her search for the missing bell-ringer. She last saw them three days ago heading past the reeds beyond the bend. When they failed to return for meals, Wenna went looking herself and discovered the ferry rope had been cut. The party learns the bell-ringer has been missing for days, suggesting foul play rather than simple negligence.",
